  <p id="c-nanqishu-049-yinheng:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanqishu-049-yinheng:p001:m0000" ref="ceq_pnr_q0e">叡</persName>族父<persName id="c-nanqishu-049-yinheng:p001:m0003" ref="gtj_19g_u2l_A">恒</persName>，字<persName id="c-nanqishu-049-yinheng:p001:m0006" ref="gtj_19g_u2l_A">昭度</persName>，與<persName id="c-nanqishu-049-yinheng:p001:m0010" ref="ceq_pnr_q0e">叡</persName>同承<persName id="c-nanqishu-049-yinheng:p001:m0013" ref="ali_hbb_4bn">融</persName>後。宋司空<persName id="c-nanqishu-049-yinheng:p001:m0019" ref="740_57f_3ec">景仁</persName>孫也。<persName id="c-nanqishu-049-yinheng:p001:m0024" ref="gtj_19g_u2l_A">恒</persName>及父<persName id="c-nanqishu-049-yinheng:p001:m0027" ref="gtj_19g_u2l">道矜</persName>，竝有古風，以是見蚩於世，其事非一。<persName id="c-nanqishu-049-yinheng:p001:m0047" ref="gtj_19g_u2l_A">恒</persName>，宋泰始初，爲度支尚書，坐屬父疾及身疾多，爲有司所奏。明帝詔曰：「<persName id="c-nanqishu-049-yinheng:p001:m0081" ref="gtj_19g_u2l">殷道矜</persName>有生便病，比更無橫病。<persName id="c-nanqishu-049-yinheng:p001:m0095" ref="gtj_19g_u2l_A">恒</persName>因愚習惰，久妨清敘。左遷散騎常侍，領校尉。」<persName id="c-nanqishu-049-yinheng:p001:m0118" ref="gtj_19g_u2l_A">恒</persName>歷官清顯，至金紫光祿大夫。建武中，卒。</p>
</text>
